Package: zathura
Version: @DEB_ZATHURA_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: X11/Wayland Apps
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://pwmt.org/projects/zathura/
Depends: libgirara-gtk3-4, libglib2.0-0, libgtk-3-0, libcairo2, libjson-glib-1.0-0, libsqlite3-1, libpango-1.0-0
Description: keyboard-driven document viewer (core)
 zathura is a highly customizable, keyboard-driven document viewer. It is
 plugin-based: install a backend (e.g. zathura-pdf-poppler) to view documents.
 Pure C/GTK3 via girara. Runs as a plain X11 client under the Xios desktop.
 Built for iOS with the seccomp/landlock sandboxes and libmagic disabled;
 file-type detection falls back to GLib content-type guessing.
